# Runtime warehouse tools

`schema`, `sql`, `show_source`, `web_search`, `rss_feed`, `press_fetch`, `fetch_url`, and any later `ToolRegistry` tools are this Cursor harness surface (MCP / `freight-sb tools`). The deployable LangChain agent (`freight-sb agent` / desk UI) is live-web only — no warehouse SQL.

1. Prefer MCP tools from the `freight-second-brain` server.
2. If those MCP tools are not connected, run `uv run freight-sb tools <name> --json '...'`.
3. Do not read parquet/JSONL directly when the task is to use or test agent tools.

Adding a handler in `register_default_tools` exposes it on `freight-sb tools` immediately and on MCP after a window reload.
